OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,6,Fturning heavier around Fraserburgh and
OL,7,FPeterhead for a time in the early
OL,8,Fafternoon, then gradually becoming
OL,9,Flighter and more patchy later in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Windy at times,
OL,11,Fparticularly around the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fin the evening but gradually easing
OL,15,Foff. Becoming mostly dry by morning
OL,16,Fwith a few clear spells developing.
OL,17,FWindy at times around the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
