OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny cloud and patchy rain at
OL,6,Ffirst will soon clear to leave bright
OL,7,For sunny spells and increasingly light
OL,8,Fwinds. Chance of the odd afternoon
OL,9,Fshower.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,12,Frain or showers over the coming days
OL,13,Fmixed with some drier and brighter
OL,14,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light on
OL,15,FSunday and Monday, likely freshening
OL,16,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
